{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Subgroup.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.QuotientGroup.Defs"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.twist_trivial_of_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.twist_trivial_of_mem","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/IntertwinerFromGenerators.lean#L67-L76","doc":"**A twist by a homomorphism into `N` is invisible in `H ⧸ N`.**  With `N` the scalars\nof a matrix group, a scalar-valued character twist vanishes projectively -- so an\nintertwining that holds only up to such a twist is an honest isomorphism there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conj_eq_of_eqOn_generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conj_eq_of_eqOn_generators","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/IntertwinerFromGenerators.lean#L57-L65","doc":"**The word-length bound for verifying an intertwining is one.**  If a single `A`\nconjugates `ρ₁` to `ρ₂` on a generating set, it does so on every element of the group.\n\nThis is what makes a finite check a proof: the conclusion is an identity on all of `G`,\nnot agreement on the elements tested. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conjHom_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conjHom_apply","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/IntertwinerFromGenerators.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conjHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.conjHom","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/IntertwinerFromGenerators.lean#L47-L55","doc":"Conjugation by a fixed element, packaged as a homomorphism, so that\n`eqOn_of_eqOn_generators` applies to it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.eqOn_of_eqOn_generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.IntertwinerFromGenerators.eqOn_of_eqOn_generators","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/IntertwinerFromGenerators.lean#L36-L45","doc":"**Two homomorphisms agreeing on a generating set are equal.**  This is the reason a\nverification on generators is a proof and not a sample. ","signatureChunk":0}]}